WEBVTT

00:09:58.502 --> 00:10:00.059
in dealing with loss.

00:10:01.077 --> 00:10:05.550
It can give people the confidence
to bring their whole self to work,

00:10:05.574 --> 00:10:07.115
and the people around them,

00:10:07.139 --> 00:10:09.606
the awareness to accept
them for who they are.

00:10:10.440 --> 00:10:11.590
And together,

00:10:12.591 --> 00:10:13.934
we'll all be better for it.

00:10:14.479 --> 00:10:17.527
Empathy training can help
people acknowledge

00:10:17.551 --> 00:10:23.177
that a coworker is a very different person
after a life-changing loss,

00:10:23.201 --> 00:10:26.537
and ask that simple and direct question:

00:10:26.561 --> 00:10:29.513
what would you like me
to do differently to help you?